  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can change the flow center of your ki with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Recenter Flow<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The ki point cost of using the special abilities granted by this feat is halved. In addition, if you expend one use of your mythic power when recentering your ki, you can choose any two dantians in which to center your ki simultaneously for a number of minutes equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
